# Phase 4: Project Development Phase

## Project Title: EduGenie – Google Gemini Powered Learning Assistant

### 1. Introduction

The Project Development Phase focuses on converting the system design into a working web application. In this phase, the frontend, backend, and Google Gemini API are integrated to create an AI-powered educational assistant.

EduGenie is developed to help students ask academic questions, generate study notes, summarize learning materials, understand difficult topics, and prepare for examinations.

### 2. Development Objectives

1. Develop an interactive and user-friendly web interface.

2. Implement an AI chatbot using Google Gemini API.

3. Create a notes generation feature.

4. Develop a text summarization module.

5. Implement an exam preparation feature.

6. Connect the frontend with the backend.

7. Ensure smooth communication between the application and AI model.

