### 7. Expected Development Output

After completing this phase, the application should provide:

* Functional web interface.

* Working AI chatbot.

* Gemini API integration.

* Notes generation.

* Text summarization.

* Exam preparation tools.

* AI-generated responses displayed on the screen.

### 8. Conclusion

The Project Development Phase transforms the design and requirements into a functional AI-powered learning platform. By integrating frontend technologies, Python Flask, and Google Gemini API, EduGenie provides students with an interactive and intelligent educational assistant.

